{{also|speedbump}}
==English==
[[Image:Speed bump (asphalt).jpg|thumb|A speed bump|upright=2.2]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[traffic calming]] measure, consisting of a [[transverse]] [[ridge]] in the [[road]], to [[limit]] the speed of [[vehicle]]s.
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} An [[obstacle]] or [[difficulty]]; [[roadblock]]; [[snag]].
# {{lb|en|finance|high-frequency trading}} Any technical measure taken by an electronic financial [[exchange]] to deliberately delay [[order]]s by [[microsecond]]s or [[millisecond]]s.

